:0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2624764298","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101952#issuecomment-2624764298","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101952","id":2624764298,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ccrmK","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T15:10:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T15:10:42Z","body":"> @Calinou, are you using 4,4,16,64 quadrants? to me it seems like what happened is a quadrant shift, which is a bit buggy\r\n\r\nI was using the default quadrant project settings. The project has a fair amount of shadow-casting spotlights (more than 8), so maybe it was due to that.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2624764298/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628948847","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101952#issuecomment-2628948847","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101952","id":2628948847,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cspNv","user":{"login":"levidavidmurray","id":46084870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDg0ODcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46084870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/levidavidmurray","html_url":"https://github.com/levidavidmurray","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/levidavidmurray/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/levidavidmurray/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/levidavidmurray/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/levidavidmurray/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/levidavidmurray/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/levidavidmurray/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/levidavidmurray/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/levidavidmurray/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/levidavidmurray/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-01T13:12:41Z","updated_at":"2025-02-01T13:12:41Z","body":"This had been bugging me since 4.4-dev7. Happy to see it fixed!\r\n\r\n| Before  | After |\r\n| ------------- | ------------- |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03211bb5-6b49-4a1b-8a2b-aae3d6a84258)  | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22ce1efb-963d-416a-9652-2353db55cc63)  |\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2628948847/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2636329047","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101952#issuecomment-2636329047","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101952","id":2636329047,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dIzBX","user":{"login":"Flarkk","id":49606622,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5NjA2NjIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/49606622?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk","html_url":"https://github.com/Flarkk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Flarkk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T10:25:20Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T13:18:08Z","body":"I made tests with the MRP provided by @Calinou.\r\n\r\n### Banding artifacts\r\nThe banding is self-shadowing artifacts.\r\nIncreasing the bias a little bit gets rid of them, at the cost of loosing shadows on smaller details.\r\nI believe there is nothing wrong in this, just the normal behavior when the light's range gets bigger and the geometry farther away.\r\n\r\nThe only point still unclear is why such banding doesn't appear with an Omni light instead of a Spotlight, with identical settings. I think it's related to the resolution of the shadow map (spotlights have a single texture where omnis have a cubemap), but this assumption would deserve to be confirmed.\r\n\r\n### Possibly broken shadowing when changing range\r\n\r\n> while shadowing does work correctly initially, it will break down once you change the spot range again\r\n\r\nI couldn't reproduce that. And I couldn't see anything going wrong with the shadows in any of the 2 videos you shared (see my previous comment https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101952#issuecomment-2613841780)\r\n\r\nWhat I noticed though in the MRP is that there is no banding artifact at startup. They re-appeared as soon as I changed the light's range. It's like the bias was set internally to a high value (no self-shadowing) and got back to normal then.\r\n\r\nWorth also noting that after saving the project with another very large range and repoening it, I couldn't reproduce this anymore. So it's still not clear what's the cause of if, but I think it's unrelated to this PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2636329047/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2641532974","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101952#issuecomment-2641532974","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101952","id":2641532974,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dcpgu","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co